      "description": "<p>The dragon breathes a blast of magma that deals 5d6 Fire Damage|options:area-damage]{5d6 fire damage and 3d12 bludgeoning damage} in a 30ft Cone (Basic DC 28 Reflex Saving Throw save).</p>\n<p>They can't use Breath Weapon again for 1d4 rounds.</p>",
